Risks and Mitigations
Risk	Impact	Mitigation
Breaking existing component integrations	High	Keep old hooks working during transition; test each feature separately
Query deduplication fails silently	Medium	Monitor React Query DevTools; add logging to unified hook
Stale time too aggressive (15 min)	Low	Configurable in hook; can adjust if needed
Data divergence between combined sources	Low	Single queryKey means they invalidate together
